    "check (the language finder raised this; it may not be a fault): ''n ander herhaal presies wat een persoon of groep pas gedoen het.': 'n ander' comes before the 'persoon of groep' it is contrasted with, so on a first reading it has no clear referent; not changed because 'herhaal presies' is protected and a reorder would split it."
