  "taal_vir_mens": [
    "[taal, protected word] 'roep-en-antwoord': The fixed definition 'Een persoon of groep sing of speel 'n kort deel en 'n ander antwoord daarop.' joins two clauses with their own subjects and verbs, so under the AWS 2017 rule it needs a comma before 'en'; left unchanged because the wording is shared for the whole subject-grade."
